  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-plugin-toggle",
      "text": "Hot-plug enable/disable switches for installed DeepSeek Harness plugins, without restarting DSH."
    },
    {
      "section": "Features",
      "text": "- List installed plugins with descriptions.\n- Enable / disable plugins live.\n- Protect core plugins (`CORE_DENYLIST`) from being disabled.\n- Auto-applies patches to official plugin inventory UI on startup.\n- The session-header preset dropdown now auto-hides when `dsh-preset-switch` is disabled (polling every 5s + on window focus, no manual refresh needed).\n- Works in the DSH Web UI Plugin list."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:aorucshiea/dsh-plugin-toggle\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Usage",
      "text": "- Open DSH Web UI → Settings → Plugins.\n- Use the **Disable / Enable** buttons.\n- Core plugins are marked **Protected**."
    },
    {
      "section": "Notes",
      "text": "- This plugin patches official client/host files at startup. It is idempotent and restores safe behavior when the target official files are in a broken state.\n- No API keys or credentials are stored in this repository."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    }
  ],
